+
+1. Complete Phase 1: Setup (baseline suite green, baseline hashes recorded)
+2. Complete Phase 2: Foundational (pre-edit twin identity confirmed)
+3. Complete Phase 3: User Story 1 (end-ack wait fits inside the Codex cap)
