+### Incremental Delivery
+
+1. Complete Setup + Foundational → baseline confirmed
+2. Add User Story 1 → validate via T006 → MVP (the actual defect fix)
+3. Add User Story 2 → validate via T009 → declared budgets become truthful (FR-001/FR-002, SC-001)
